//
// Setup: Reads std/arch_aarch64/aarch64_abi.oo for the new NEON/FP register conventions, the openOODA/scripts/enforcer.oo shell for the 8 gates, and the modified aarch64_emit_alu.oo plus aarch64_emit_secret.oo for the type-annotation repair.
//
